# I18nOverride suite: the production i18n TU is the unit under test (the fixture is the only other TU).
# The fixture substitutes the three core boundaries i18n.cpp touches (EmbeddedResource for the
# resource-103 bytes, Log for diagnostics, ModDir for per-case scratch directories); the imgui TUs below
# satisfy the font-atlas references of the production TU (MergeSystemFonts is linked, never called here).
# The WB_I18N_HOST_TEST define enables the TestReset seam (host-only, absent from the ASI build).
@include tools/imgui
asi/cdmodkit/i18n.cpp
tools/imgui/imgui.cpp
tools/imgui/imgui_draw.cpp
tools/imgui/imgui_tables.cpp
tools/imgui/imgui_widgets.cpp
@define WB_I18N_HOST_TEST
# @evidence entries are hashed into the run receipt and are never passed to the compiler as sources.
@evidence asi/cdmodkit/i18n.cpp
@evidence asi/cdmodkit/i18n.h
@evidence asi/cdmodkit/data/locales.tsv
@evidence tests/wb_groups/i18n_override.sources
